itter:creator","content":"@utsuboco"},{"name":"twitter:site","content":"@utsuboco"}],"links":[{"rel":"canonical","href":"https://www.utsubo.com/webgl-threejs-development"},{"rel":"alternate","hreflang":"en","href":"https://www.utsubo.com/webgl-threejs-development"},{"rel":"alternate","hreflang":"x-default","href":"https://www.utsubo.com/webgl-threejs-development"}],"jsonLd":["{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"headline\":\"WebGL & Three.js Development Studio | Real-Time 3D Websites | Kiasa\",\"description\":\"Award-winning WebGL, Three.js & WebGPU development. FWA and Awwwards-recognized real-time 3D websites that keep Lighthouse 90+. Own Gaussian-splat renderer. Trusted by BMW, Louis Vuitton, Warner Music. From $20K.\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Kiasa\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/icons/web-app-manifest-512x512.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.kiasa.tech/\",\"https://www.kiasa.tech/\",\"https://www.kiasa.tech/\"]},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Kiasa\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/icons/web-app-manifest-512x512.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.kiasa.tech/\",\"https://www.kiasa.tech/\",\"https://www.kiasa.tech/\"]},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/webgl-threejs-development\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/landing/ja/osaka-web-seisaku/ogp.png\",\"width\":1600,\"height\":900},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"serviceType\":\"WebGL & Three.js Development\",\"areaServed\":[\"Worldwide\"],\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Kiasa\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"postalCode\":\"542-0086\",\"addressRegion\":\"Osaka\",\"addressLocality\":\"Chuo-ku, Osaka\",\"streetAddress\":\"1-13-18 Nishishinsaibashi\",\"addressCountry\":\"JP\"},\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/icons/web-app-manifest-512x512.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512}},\"keywords\":[\"WebGL development studio\",\"Three.js development\",\"hire Three.js developers\",\"WebGPU development\",\"3D website development\",\"real-time 3D web development\",\"interactive 3D web experiences\"],\"about\":[\"WebGL\",\"Three.js\",\"WebGPU\",\"real-time 3D\",\"Gaussian splatting\",\"performance optimization\"]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.utsubo.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"WebGL & Three.js Development Studio | Real-Time 3D Websites | Kiasa\",\"item\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/webgl-threejs-development\"}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/webgl-threejs-development#faqs\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What do you build with WebGL and Three.js?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Premium marketing and brand sites with real-time 3D, product visualization and 3D configurators, virtual showrooms, interactive data visualization, browser-based experiences and installations extended to the web. If it renders in a browser in real time, it is our territory.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Three.js, WebGPU, or something custom — how do you choose?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We default to Three.js for its ecosystem and stability, adopt WebGPU where it pays (compute-heavy scenes, massive instancing) with automatic WebGL fallback, and use our in-house Gaussian-splat renderer when photoreal capture needs to mix with real-time 3D. The choice is driven by your audience’s devices, not by novelty.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Will a 3D site hurt performance or SEO?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Not the way we build it. We defer the 3D payload past first paint, move heavy work into workers via OffscreenCanvas, and keep all critical content server-rendered. Recent work scores 90+ on Lighthouse performance despite full-screen 3D.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does a project take?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A 3D hero or section: 4–6 weeks. A full 3D-driven site: 8–14 weeks depending on content and integrations. We share playable builds early and iterate on real devices throughout.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you work with our in-house team or existing designs?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We regularly take finished designs and deliver the 3D/front-end engineering, or embed alongside in-house developers to own just the real-time layer — shaders, optimization, and deployment included.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you handle ongoing maintenance?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We offer maintenance covering browser updates, dependency upgrades, performance monitoring, and content changes — typically 15–20% of the build cost per year.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where are you located, and do you work with international clients?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We are based in Osaka, Japan, and most of our client roster is international — including BMW, Louis Vuitton, and Warner Music. We work async-first in English with overlap hours for US and European time zones.\"}}]}"],"features":["contact-form","faq"],"html":"<div class=\"progressive-blur\" data-astro-cid-v3ivnume><div class=\"blur-layer\" style=\"\n            backdrop-filter: blur(0.078125px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(0.078125px);\n            z-index: 1;\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%);\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0